---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Lot & Lounge privacy policy: no accounts or forms, what partner affiliate scripts and hosting may collect, and how to contact us." path="privacy/">
  <PageHead title="Privacy policy" eyebrow="Legal" />
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose read page-body">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 22 Nov 2026</p>

    <h2 id="data">What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't run accounts, forms, comments or email sign-ups, and we don't ask for your name, email address or phone number.</li>
      <li>The free Airport Day Packing Checklist is a direct PDF download. You don't need to give us anything to get it.</li>
      <li>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@lotandlounge.com">hello@lotandlounge.com</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="partners">Partner and affiliate scripts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every page loads scripts from two affiliate networks, Stay22 and Travelpayouts. They can turn some travel and hotel links into affiliate links, so a partner may pay us a commission if you book. See the <a href="../affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</li>
      <li>These scripts are run by those companies and may set cookies or similar identifiers and receive technical data such as your IP address, browser and the page you're on, to attribute bookings. Their own privacy policies apply.</li>
      <li>We don't run our own analytics or advertising cookies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="hosting">Hosting and other sites</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log technical data such as IP addresses for security and operations; see GitHub's privacy statement.</li>
      <li>When you click a link to another site (an airport, lounge operator or booking site), that site's own privacy policy applies.</li>
      <li>If anything here changes, we'll update this page first.</li>
    </ul>
  </div></div>
</Base>
